# Primary auxiliaries (be, have, do; also used as main verbs) and the modal auxiliaries.
be       aux pres=am,are,is,are,are,are past=was,were,was,were,were,were pp=been ing=being subj=were
have     aux 3sg=has past=had pp=had
do       aux 3sg=does past=did pp=done
can      aux modal past=could
cannot   aux modal note=can + not, written as one word
may      aux modal past=might
must     aux modal
ought    aux modal note=ought to
shall    aux modal past=should
will     aux modal past=would
